    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12407" root="درج" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِدْرَاجٌ</span></b>  A she-camel <i>that is accustomed to go
beyond the year</i> [<i>from the day when she was
covered</i>] <i>without bringing forth:</i> (S:) or <i>that
exceeds the year by some days, three</i> or <i>four</i> or
<i>ten; not more.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدْرِجٌ</span>.

